Yes, Hyprland has a built-in keybind for toggling between the current and last used workspace:

````ini
// filepath: /home/heisenberg/.config/hypr/hyprland.conf
// ...existing code...
bind = Alt, Tab, workspace, back_and_forth
// ...existing code...
````

This uses the `back_and_forth` action, which switches between your two most recently used workspaces.  
No script is needed for this behavior.
